Z||000002||rogergarrison||11-20-2001||09:37 PM||||I believe 355 all used 16 inch. They also were a departure from the 'fat' 5 star spokes. They went to a style like Millia Miglia II from the Tirerack.com. I have the older style on my 308 replica (modified).<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=11878523&p=52990885"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||artherd||11-21-2001||03:45 AM||||225/40/18 front (18x7.5")<BR>265/40/18 rear  (18x10")<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.ferrari.it/ferrari/images/heritage/gtcar_heritage/780x490/96F355SPIDER.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.ferrari.it/ferrari/images/heritage/gtcar_heritage/780x490/94_F355_BERLINETTA_r.jpg"> <P>Acording to the bible: <A HREF="http://www.ferrari.it/cgi-bin/fworld.dll/ferrariworld/scripts/gt/car_data.jsp?car_type=GT&CAR_ID=F355_GTS" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ferrari.it/cgi-bin/fworld.dll/ferrariworld/scripts/gt/car_data.jsp?car_type=GT&CAR_ID=F355_GTS</A>   <P>~;0)<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>I believe 355 all used 16 inch. They also were a departure from the 'fat' 5 star spokes. They went to a style like Millia Miglia II from the Tirerack.com. I have the older style on my 308 replica (modified).<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
