Z||000009||Formula88||11-23-2001||10:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by artherd:<BR><B>225/55/16<BR>165/50/16<P>Easially my favourite of the '308' series  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>Oh, YES! Hands down best 308 series.  Is that a 348 GTO?  Now, that or a 355 rebody is what I'd like to do.  N* would make a great powerplant for that.  Or a ZZ4 SBC, with aftermarket port fuel injection that has a separate throttle and velocity stack for each cylinder.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Oh, yes, oh yes, oh yes!<BR> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||14
