Z||000012||Spyder||11-24-2001||10:55 AM||||Those wheels are ROH ZS: <A HREF="http://www.jdwheels.com/roh_zs.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jdwheels.com/roh_zs.htm</A> <BR>17x7.5 $200 each<BR>17x9.5 $238 each<BR>For a total of $876.00<BR>Best price for the look and size.<P>||||reg||1
